This document is a draft pending the doctor’s approval. This draft grants no rights of use.

© 2026 張瑋麟 / Dr. WeiLin Chang. Starting year: 【待醫師決定】whether to use 2026 as the starting year.

1. Content

Articles and case content in src/content/, images (including public/images/ and any article images), and site text are © 張瑋麟 / Dr. WeiLin Chang, except third-party materials used under their original licenses. All rights reserved. Reproduction, adaptation, or redistribution requires prior written permission.

【待醫師決定】Optional clause: whether short excerpts may be quoted with attribution (the author’s name) and a link back to the original page. If allowed, the maximum excerpt length and whether commercial use is excluded remain for the doctor to decide. This clause is not in effect and grants no permission to quote.

【待醫師決定】Third-party stock images remain subject to their original licenses. Their sources are recorded in article frontmatter fields coverCredit/coverCreditUrl. This wording is pending the doctor’s approval and grants no additional rights to third-party images.

2. Code

The license for source code, configuration, scripts, and styles is separate from the content license and has NOT yet been decided. Until a decision is made, no code license is granted; all rights are reserved by default.

【待醫師決定】Choose one; none of these options has been adopted:
(A) MIT License: a permissive license allowing others to reuse the code under its terms.
(B) All rights reserved: no reuse is licensed.
(C) Other: for example, Apache-2.0; the specific license remains for the doctor to decide.

Medical disclaimer: Site content is for health education reference only and does not constitute medical advice (本站內容僅供衛教參考，不構成診療建議).

